      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wulodi aighu ya walodi wa womi wa tee",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA ukaghora nani ukighamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwana wa mdamu, Funya wulodi aighu ya walodi wa Israeli kuwizere awo wilodagha malagho wikitumia akili rawo reni, wikighamba, ‘Sikirenyi ilagho ja BWANA!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwana MLUNGU waghamba huwu, Ni bugha kwa awo walodi wikelie, winughagha mawoni gha roho rawo reni wisewonie kindo chingi! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walodi wenyu weeka sa mizozo iko maghachonyi ee Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndem'wuelindia andu kunonelo, hata ndemuaghie wurigha kwa wundu ghwa wandu wa Israeli, wipate kumanga wudenyi ngelo ya ituku ja BWANA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wadedie malagho ghiseko gha loli, na kulaghua malagho gha tee wikighamba, ‘BWANA waghamba,’ sena usewidumie; na ii chia wikisuwiria BWANA uwikatishire wulodi ghwawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele huwo ndemoowona mawono ghiseko gha loli, na kulaghua malagho gha tee iji mghoragha, ‘BWANA waghamba’ sena niseghorie ilagho jingi anguwada?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa huwo Bwana MLUNGU waghamba huwu, “Kwa kukaia mwadeda malagho ghiseko gha loli, na kuwona malagho gha tee, olenyi nichalwa nenyo, waghamba Bwana MLUNGU. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nichawikaba walodi wiwonagha mawono gha tee, na kulaghua malagho gha tee; ndewichaakaia andenyi ya njama ra wandu wapo, hata ndewichaandikwa andenyi ya chuo cha wandu wa Israeli, angu kungia andenyi ya isanga ja Israeli; nenyo mchamanya kukaia Ini ne Bwana MLUNGU. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa kukaia wawilaghashire wandu wapo wikighamba, ‘Sere,’ sena sere iseko; na wandu wikaagha wurigha kisha-kisha, awo walodi wadaghushinga chokaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.6.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jer. 6.14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.8.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "8.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuwizere awo wawuyaghushinga ugho wurigha chokaa kukaia ghuchaghwa. Kuchakaia na vua mbaa, vua mbaa ya magho, na kiremba kibaa chichacha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Welee, ingelo ugho wurigha ghwaghwa wandu ndewichaakotia, ‘Uko kushinga chokaa konyu moreshingagha ugho wurigha kuao?’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kwa huwo ini Bwana MLUNGU naghamba huwu, Nichareda kiremba kibaa kwa lubio lwapo, na vua mbaa kwa machu ghapo na vua ya magho ichaghunona ugho wurigha kwa lubio lwapo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nani nichaghuchikanya ugho wurigha moreghushingieghe chokaa na kughusasara andoenyi, eri msingi ghwaro ghusigho mduu; na iji ghwameria kughwa, inyo mchatoteshwa aghadi yaro, nenyo mchamanya kukaia ini ne BWANA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Huwo niko nichaaghikatisha machu ghapo aighu ya ugho wurigha, na aighu ya awo wandu wereghushingagha chokaa kisha-kisha; nani nichamzera inyo: Ugho wurigha ndeghuko, na awo wereghushingagha chokaa wori ndewiko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo walodi wa Israeli werefunyagha wulodi aighu ya Jerusalemu, na kuwona mawono gha sere kwa wundu ghwaro, ingelo sere ingi iseko, ndewiko. Ini Bwana MLUNGU naghamba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wulodi aighu ya walodi wa waka wa tee",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Na oho mwana wa mdamu, zighana waka wa mzenyu awo wilodagha malagho wikitumia akili rawo reni; kuwilodere ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kughambe, ini Bwana MLUNGU naghamba huwu, Ni bugha kwa awo waka widungagha mbingu refunga vikotonyi vose, na kubonya vitambaa vefunga vongo va wandu wa kula kipimo, wipate kukaia na nguma aighu ya marangi gha wandu! Welee, mwadima kukaia na nguma aighu ya marangi gha wandu wapo, msighe wamu wikaie moyo kwa wundu ghwa fwaida renyu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwamerie kunilusha aghadi ya wandu wapo kwa wundu ghopata shairi ndinieri na vipande va mkate, nenyo mkawibwagha wandu wiserekoghe wefwa, na kuwisigha awo wandu werekoghe wefwa wikaie moyo, kwa chia ya tee renyu kwa wandu wapo, awo wawuyasikira tee renyu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kwa huwo ini Bwana MLUNGU naghamba huwu, Ola ini narilegha iro mbingu m'bonyeragha naro wandu nguma; nani nicharirashua rifume mikonunyi konyu, na kuwifungua awo wandu wikaie huru sa nyonyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na vitambaa venyu wori nichavirashua, nani nichawikira wandu wapo wisekaie madiwo ghenyu sena; nenyo mchamanya angu Ini ne BWANA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa kukaia mwam'bwaghie ngolo mhachi kwa tee renyu, ini nisem'bwaghie ngolo; na kumkumba ngolo mmbiwi useghaluke na kughusigha wuwiwi ghwake ukire irangi jake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyo wori kwa wundu ugho, ndemchaakaia mkiwona mawono gha tee sena, hata kulaghua, ela nichawikira wandu wapo wifume konyu. Niko mchamanya kukaia ini ne BWANA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
